sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant UI as React UI<br/>(Dashboard / Exam Page)
    participant API as API Layer<br/>(Express + auth middleware)
    participant EX as Exam Management<br/>Service
    participant DB as MongoDB<br/>(exams, attempts, answers, focusEvents)
    participant AUD as Audit & Logging<br/>Service

    S->>UI: Click "Start" on an Open exam (dashboard, FR-OE-013)
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/exams/{examId}/attempts
    API->>API: authenticate (JWT + session) + authorize(role = Student) (SEC-OE-004)
    API->>EX: startAttempt(studentId, examId)
    EX->>DB: find exam + assignment for student
    DB-->>EX: exam {startAt, endAt, durationMin, shuffle, status}
    alt Not assigned to this student
        EX-->>API: Forbidden
        API-->>UI: 403 FORBIDDEN
    else serverNow outside [startAt, endAt] (NFR-OE-010)
        EX-->>API: ExamNotOpen
        API-->>UI: 409 EXAM_NOT_OPEN
    else Attempt already SUBMITTED (FR-OE-014: only once)
        EX-->>API: AttemptAlreadySubmitted
        API-->>UI: 409 ATTEMPT_ALREADY_SUBMITTED
    else Attempt IN_PROGRESS exists (resume, FR-OE-018)
        EX->>DB: load attempt + saved answers
        Note right of EX: endsAt is NOT reset - timer continues<br/>from the original end time
    else First start
        EX->>DB: insert attempt {startedAt = serverNow,<br/>endsAt = min(serverNow + duration, exam.endAt), status = IN_PROGRESS}<br/>(unique index on examId + studentId)
        EX->>DB: set exam.locked = true (FR-OE-012)
        EX->>AUD: log ATTEMPT_STARTED
    end
    EX->>DB: load questions with projection excluding correctOption (SEC-OE-007)
    EX->>EX: Apply question / option shuffle using attempt seed (FR-OE-009)
    EX-->>API: {attemptId, questions, savedAnswers, endsAt, serverTime}
    API-->>UI: 201 Created (200 if resumed)
    UI->>UI: offset = serverTime - clientNow, render countdown = endsAt - (clientNow + offset) (FR-OE-016)

    loop Answer, change, navigate, flag (FR-OE-015)
        S->>UI: Select / change option, flag question, jump via navigator
        UI->>UI: Update local state, mark "Unsaved"
    end

    loop Every 30 s AND on every answer change (debounced 1 s) (FR-OE-017)
        UI->>API: PATCH /api/v1/attempts/{attemptId}/answers {answers[], clientSeq}
        API->>EX: saveAnswers(attemptId, studentId, answers, clientSeq)
        EX->>EX: Check owner = studentId and serverNow <= endsAt + 5 s (SEC-OE-009)
        alt Attempt closed or expired
            EX-->>API: AttemptClosed
            API-->>UI: 409 ATTEMPT_CLOSED
            UI->>UI: Stop editing, show "Time over - submitting"
        else Valid
            EX->>DB: bulkWrite upsert answers (ignore if clientSeq <= lastSeq)
            EX-->>API: {savedAt, serverTime}
            API-->>UI: 200 OK (target <= 1 s, NFR-OE-002)
            UI->>UI: Show "All changes saved hh:mm:ss", re-sync timer offset
        end
    end

    opt Window loses focus / tab switched (FR-OE-021)
        UI->>UI: visibilitychange / blur event
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/attempts/{attemptId}/focus-events {type, occurredAt}
        API->>EX: recordFocusEvent(attemptId, event)
        EX->>DB: insert focusEvent {attemptId, type, serverTimestamp}
        API-->>UI: 202 Accepted
    end
